  "summary": "preinstall reverse shell to hardcoded IP with canarytoken beacon",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall lifecycle hook that runs on `npm install`. The hook spawns an interactive bash reverse shell to 147.93.157.202:8080 via /dev/tcp and pipes the shell's output into a POST to http://canarytokens.com/terms/7dc94zmd3so67n5vbz5bxmt7v/contact.php. Installing the package therefore grants a remote party interactive shell access on the installer's host and simultaneously beacons out-of-band that the install occurred. The tarball ships only package.json; the entire package is the delivery vehicle for this preinstall payload.",
